00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:53.580
Yeah. And I think one thing that was impossible for a game like Urban Champion to do, but Ring King, in my opinion, succeeds at is that you can take full advantage of the mat and and kind of do like semicircles around your opponent or quarter turns so that you actually are kind of in, you know, a pseudo 3D environment.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:05:04.820
